```

把仓库加进 `dependencies` + `dsh.profile.bundles`:

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "dsh-vidgen-plugin": "link:/绝对路径/到/dsh-vidgen-plugin"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": ["dsh-vidgen-plugin"]
    }
  }
}
```

然后:

```bash
pnpm install   # 建立 symlink
```
